      "start": 45.64,
      "end": 49.82,
      "text": "Let's move from possibility to something you can inspect."
    },
    {
      "start": 50.947,
      "end": 53.4,
      "text": "Every journey has a call to action."
    },
    {
      "start": 53.4,
      "end": 56.28,
      "text": "Mine starts by understanding the room."
    },
    {
      "start": 56.28,
      "end": 60.72,
      "text": "An executive needs to connect a capability to a business decision."
    },
    {
      "start": 60.76,
      "end": 65.4,
      "text": "A solution architect needs to see the boundaries, dependencies, and"
    },
    {
      "start": 65.4,
      "end": 70.36,
      "text": "tradeoffs. Sales needs a story the customer recognizes."
    },
    {
      "start": 70.36,
      "end": 74.4,
      "text": "Internal teams need something they can deliver again."
    },
    {
      "start": 74.48,
      "end": 78.6,
      "text": "I design those entry points around one technical foundation."
    },
    {
      "start": 78.6,
      "end": 82.62,
      "text": "Choose an audience here, and the emphasis changes with it."
    },
    {
      "start": 82.62,
      "end": 87.46199999999999,
      "text": "The craft is knowing what to reveal, when to reveal it, and which"
    },
    {
      "start": 87.46199999999999,
      "end": 90.96000000000001,
      "text": "evidence helps this person move forward."
    },
    {
      "start": 91.88799999999999,
      "end": 96.17999999999999,
      "text": "The work takes different forms because the audience needs different ways in."
    },
    {
      "start": 96.22,
      "end": 101.23299999999999,
      "text": "The Great CPU Bake Off turns a placement decision into a memorable"
    },
    {
      "start": 101.23299999999999,
      "end": 105.97999999999999,
      "text": "business story. Edge Inference at Scale connects constrained"
    },
    {
      "start": 105.97999999999999,
      "end": 108.62,
      "text": "compute to a human need."
    },
    {
      "start": 108.8,
      "end": 113.66,
      "text": "AERIS explores a cinematic inspection scenario, clearly labeled as a"
    },
    {
      "start": 113.66,
      "end": 118.37199999999999,
      "text": "concept. Triforce brings the depth: multi-agent"
    },
    {
      "start": 118.37199999999999,
      "end": 122.83999999999999,
      "text": "workflows, tools, event contracts, and heterogeneous"
    },
    {
      "start": 122.83999999999999,
      "end": 127.06,
      "text": "compute. The platform story is Red Hat aligned."
    },
    {
      "start": 127.1,
      "end": 132.14,
      "text": "Intel reference work, recorded AMD runs, historical"
    },
    {
      "start": 132.14,
      "end": 136.923,
      "text": "NVIDIA fleet evidence, and Arm portability each have their own"
    },
    {
      "start": 136.923,
      "end": 140.998,
      "text": "qualification boundary. Different stories, one"
    },
    {
      "start": 140.998,
      "end": 145.42,
      "text": "discipline: make the mechanism clear, show what the evidence"
    },
    {
      "start": 145.42,
      "end": 149.86,
      "text": "supports, and give the audience a useful next step."
    },
    {
      "start": 150.924,
      "end": 153.16,
      "text": "Now cross the threshold into the system."
    },
    {
      "start": 153.28,
      "end": 155.7,
      "text": "A diagram should answer a question."
    },
    {
      "start": 155.7,
      "end": 160.011,
      "text": "Trace the request, reveal the boundary, then explain why that component"
    },
    {
      "start": 160.011,
      "end": 164.48,
      "text": "exists. In Triforce, Python, Java, and Go"
    },
    {
      "start": 164.48,
      "end": 168.862,
      "text": "connect business workflows through tools, routing, and event-driven"
    },
    {
      "start": 168.862,
      "end": 173.911,
      "text": "coordination. In the Praxis lab, application teams use a stable gateway"
    },
    {
      "start": 173.911,
      "end": 177.72,
      "text": "contract while the platform controls backend choices."
    },
    {
      "start": 177.72,
      "end": 182.24,
      "text": "Red Hat OpenShift provides a common platform context across this"
    },
    {
      "start": 182.24,
      "end": 187.013,
      "text": "work. Hardware portability becomes a design discipline: preserve the"
    },
    {
      "start": 187.013,
      "end": 191.84,
      "text": "application contract, qualify each target, and show the evidence for the"
    },
    {
      "start": 191.84,
      "end": 194.12,
      "text": "path actually being discussed."
    },
    {
      "start": 195.052,
      "end": 198.78,
      "text": "A convincing demonstration should survive a difficult question."
    },
    {
      "start": 198.78799999999998,
      "end": 201.18,
      "text": "What happens when the evidence is missing?"
    },
    {
      "start": 201.20399999999998,
      "end": 203.66,
      "text": "What if permission is withdrawn?"
    },
    {
      "start": 203.7,
      "end": 207.9,
      "text": "This chapter lets you test that idea in a browser simulation."
    },
    {
      "start": 208.01999999999998,
      "end": 210.62,
      "text": "No model or backend is running here."
    },
    {
      "start": 210.62599999999998,
      "end": 214.14,
      "text": "Change a condition and watch the decision respond."
    },
    {
      "start": 214.16,
      "end": 218.51999999999998,
      "text": "The purpose is to make the rule understandable, including the point where"
    },
    {
      "start": 218.51999999999998,
      "end": 222.72,
      "text": "the system must stop. The wider portfolio separates source"
    },
    {
      "start": 222.72,
      "end": 227.50799999999998,
      "text": "implementations, recorded results, and rehearsal candidates."
    },
    {
      "start": 227.50799999999998,
      "end": 231.85999999999999,
      "text": "That clarity gives an architect something to inspect, and a business leader"
    },
    {
      "start": 231.85999999999999,
      "end": 234.45999999999998,
      "text": "a sound basis for the next conversation."
    },
    {
      "start": 235.388,
      "end": 238.863,
      "text": "The reward is a capability that travels beyond one presenter."
    },
    {
      "start": 238.863,
      "end": 241.6,
      "text": "Launchpad is central to that ambition."
    },
    {
      "start": 241.6,
      "end": 245.95999999999998,
      "text": "Its documented pilot brings catalog intake, individual labs,"
    },
    {
      "start": 245.95999999999998,
      "end": 250.724,
      "text": "workshops, qualification checks, and environment cleanup into a shared"
    },
    {
      "start": 250.724,
      "end": 254.32,
      "text": "delivery experience. Participants get a place to learn."
    },
    {
      "start": 254.387,
      "end": 256.95,
      "text": "Instructors get a repeatable workshop."
    },
    {
      "start": 256.95,
      "end": 259.84,
      "text": "Content teams get a path to contribute."
    },
    {
      "start": 259.96,
      "end": 264.84,
      "text": "The same principle shapes my sovereign AI, virtualization, and"
    },
    {
      "start": 264.84,
      "end": 269.68,
      "text": "agentic learning tracks: connect a concise story to architecture,"
    },
    {
      "start": 269.84,
      "end": 273.448,
      "text": "a separate hands-on lab, and an evidence-aware"
    },
    {
      "start": 273.448,
      "end": 278.267,
      "text": "handoff. One investment can support executive conversations,"
    },
    {
      "start": 278.267,
      "end": 283.12,
      "text": "sales discovery, technical depth, and internal enablement."
    },
    {
      "start": 284.045,
      "end": 288.291,
      "text": "The journey returns to the audience with something useful: a clearer"
    },
    {
      "start": 288.291,
      "end": 292.61,
      "text": "decision, an inspectable system, and a path to take the work"
    },
    {
      "start": 292.61,
      "end": 296.5,
      "text": "forward. That is what I bring as a demo engineer."
    },
    {
      "start": 296.51300000000003,
      "end": 300.97400000000005,
      "text": "Storytelling and technical leadership meet in the same experience."
    },
    {
      "start": 300.97400000000005,
      "end": 303.50600000000003,
      "text": "Motion gives the idea shape."
    },
    {
      "start": 303.50600000000003,
      "end": 307.82,
      "text": "Architecture explains the mechanism. Evidence earns"
    },
    {
      "start": 307.82,
      "end": 312.44,
      "text": "confidence. Reusable delivery helps the organization carry it"
    },
    {
      "start": 312.44,
      "end": 317.49100000000004,
      "text": "further. This portfolio is an invitation to explore that craft"
    },
    {
      "start": 317.49100000000004,
      "end": 322.54,
      "text": "together. Choose a real customer problem, and let's walk through"
    },
    {
      "start": 322.54,
      "end": 326.98,
      "text": "how I would turn it into an experience that makes the next step clear."
    }
  ],
  "captionSource": "ElevenLabs character timestamps",
  "visualTiming": "Every narrative change is tied to a spoken phrase, not an estimated fraction."
}
